<title>FRANCE: EU raises refund on wheat flour exports - ONIC.</title>
<headline>EU raises refund on wheat flour exports - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the daily refund on exports of soft wheat flour to 26.50 Ecus per tonne from 24.50 Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
